@startuml SD-09-manage-staff-request
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActorBorderColor black
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBorderColor black
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBorderColor black
skinparam EntityBackgroundColor white
skinparam EntityBorderColor black
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor black
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor black
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor white
skinparam SequenceReferenceBackgroundColor white
skinparam SequenceReferenceBorderColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam dpi 150
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceActorFontSize 12
autonumber
title SD-09: Decide Staff Requests (UC-09)
' Traces: UC-09; FR-17, FR-23, FR-24, FR-25, FR-63, FR-64, FR-66, FR-70
' Sources: DEC-02, DEC-13, DEC-42, DEC-43, DEC-51, DEC-52; DEC-55, DEC-56; sequence-diagram-review.md.
actor Manager
boundary ":RequestReview\nPage" as Page
control ":Request\nController" as RQ

Manager -> Page : openPendingRequests()
activate Page
Page -> RQ ++ : listPending()
RQ --> Page -- : requests; Short notice highlighted
Manager -> Page : decideRequest(\nrequest,\ndecision,\nreason)
alt Leave Request
  Page -> RQ : decideLeave(\nrequest,\ndecision,\nreason)
  ref over RQ : SD-20
  RQ --> Page : decision / unchanged with reason
else Late Availability Change Request
  Page -> RQ : decideLateChange(\nrequest,\ndecision,\nreason)
  ref over RQ : SD-21
  RQ --> Page : decision / unchanged with reason
else Job Rejection Request
  Page -> RQ : decideJobRejection(\nrequest,\ndecision,\nreason)
  ref over RQ : SD-22
  RQ --> Page : decision / Lapsed / current status
end
Page --> Manager : current outcome
deactivate Page
legend bottom
Each fragment rechecks Pending status. A stale/invalid decision makes
no change and sends no decision notification.
Reallocation is a separate UC-07 action after approval; it does not
delay the outcome notification.
endlegend
@enduml
